DESCRIPTION:The much-loved Sue Timms returns with her faithful band of Sues
 . Join the piano-wielding prophet on an extraordinary journey across Wales 
 in search of a miracle. A hilarious and life-affirming musical comedy about
  loneliness\, resilience and small acts of kindness\, as Sue changes the wo
 rld\, one song at a time. From Emmy/BAFTA-winning Daf James and team behind
  The Stage’s must-see My Name is Sue. **** (Times). **** (Time Out). ****
  (Scotsman). This will be a special stripped-back version of the show\, rei
 magined for Shedinburgh.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/e
 vent/songs-from-across-the-sueniverse/
